| **Cache logic in price lookup** | Updated `fetchSingleAssetPrice` in `financeApi.ts` to:<br>1️⃣ Check the cache first.<br>2️⃣ Store successful results (default TTL 5 min).<br>3️⃣ Keep the original fallback to local data. |
